<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">- Dũya Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">Uafisa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ubvur Uburhu aka atsɛnge abi Uafisa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Uafisa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Uafi</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ubvur Uburhu aka atsɛnge abi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Uafisa</para>
  <para style="imt">Utsutson ri itsi ubvur Uafisa</para>
  <para style="ip">Awu Uburhu unga atsɛng ubvur uwirɛ ri ivangyɛ unga aka awe ru ugbor uzĩ ru Uroma. Atsɛng ubvur uwirɛ ugɛɛ ra amɛk aki 60 udzur ru unumkpi umbɔ aka amar Uyesu. Uburhu atsɛnge ubvur uwurɛ ra abi Uafisa ugɛ umbɔ aba avarha amaambɔ, umbɔ adene umgbɔ uzĩ ra abika adɔsa abɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Undzumu ubinkpi uku uwe ru ubvur uwirɛ awu ubinkpi Unum aka anyanga ra amɛnnga awuri ikɔng anera ru upfung kishoo atsuke ra anɔnɔr ijee Uyesu Ukiristo, asi íwea anera ukpekũ, bɔr nggu kishoo abin aka amuna ra afã nu abĩ. Ubvur ha uni idɛyiwe udĩkpi Unum Utɛ aka akũ asɛng anernga, unga adɛyiwe imimutanga ru udĩ itsũwe arhimmbɔ, na afɔrhe umbɔ ri ijee arhim ru ubok akpe Uyesu Ukiristo, utsɛku unga aka atsu ibibemuwenga itsuifɛr ri idene Ipfu Isarsatangge. Ubvur ha ufituwe abika adɔsa ugɛ umbɔ asei iseimbɔ ru utsĩndĩwi iki idɛyiwe ugɛ awu idzidzɛrhe umbɔ awu unying. Ikɛi ubvur ha ufituwe abika adɔsa ugɛ umbɔ asisei nggu adɔka ru udĩkpi uku idɛyiwe ugɛ umbɔ awu abika adɔsa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ru ubvur uwirɛ awuri ikpombɔ arherhakɛ aka adɛyiwe iwɛrha aner Unum nggu Ukiristo. Akpanga aner Ukiristo nggu iyor unera, Ukiristo iganga awu itsia. Akpanga umbɔ nggu utsɛrh uku ufa, Ukiristo unga awu utsak uku ufa. Akpanga umbɔ nggu idzin, Ukiristo unga awu utarhkpi uku utsu idzina kishoo idɛ̃ɛ̃ iker.</para>
  <para style="iot">Abinkɛ aka awe umɔ</para>
  <para style="io1">Utsutson <char style="ior">(<ref loc="EPH 1:1-2">1.1-2</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ukiristo nggu ikikɔng abika adɔsa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="EPH 1:3-3:21">1.3—3.21</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Urhɛ uku ufa ru ubok Ukiristo <char style="ior">(<ref loc="EPH 4:1-6:20">4.1—6.20</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Arherhe aki imaatak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="EPH 6:21-24">6.21-24</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1"/>Awu umum Uburhu itsɛng ubvur uwirɛ. Umum iwu uner itser Uyesu Ukiristo. Unum asɛng umum iwu uner itser Uyesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:1">Umum itsɛnge ubvur uwurɛ ra abika adɔsa ru uteu Uafisa, abika awe ru imangmang ru Ukiristo Uyesu.<verse eid="EPH 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2"/>Imimuta nu ididɔɔr idzeku Unum Utɛmɛn nu Uteijee Uyesu Ukiristo iba ru umbi.<verse eid="EPH 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Idorh ru ubok Ukiristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3"/>Ikpikpoi iwe ru Unum nu Utɛ uwu Uteijeemɛn Uyesu Ukiristo, aka atsukanga ri ipfumɛn ubɛn idorh iki idze ra afã ru ubok iwɛrhɛmɛn nggu Ukiristo. <verse eid="EPH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4"/>Unga aka asɛnga umɛn ru ubok Ukiristo na adɔrha amunu upfunga, ngge itsu umɛn iwe asasar ni ishimɛn ru uvau ra asunga. Ri ibibema <verse eid="EPH 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5"/>unga aka atsũ umɛn isha rimɔ̃ɔ̃ umɛn iwe ru nyaka angwɛ̃nga ru ubok Uyesu Ukiristo. Unum atsũ ikorha akɛrɛ ha nu ake atsu unga agũibɛn. <verse eid="EPH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6"/>Umɛn ikpoi unga ru nggaa imimutanga aka adzaa umɛn izũwã ru ubok uwu ha unga aka abema. <verse eid="EPH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7"/>Uyesu afai arhimmɛn nggu adzirhnga. Aka atsũwãmbɔ arhimmɛn na afɔnambɔ umɛn. Unum akorhe rimi ubinkutsu unga awea ru nggaa imimuta iyiriyɛ <verse eid="EPH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8"/>unga aka adzaa ru umɛn irhɛirhɛ. Nggu itsoi nu ihwihwɛng kishoo, <verse eid="EPH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9"/>unga aka adɛyiwanga umɛn ubinkpi uku uwe ri iwɔk unga aka abee ikorhe ru ubok Ukiristo. <verse eid="EPH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10"/>Unum awuri itsu ake atɔ̃ itser ri ivanga uku kpengkpeng ngge itsú abina kishoo ra afã nu abĩ awe ananga unying ru ijee Ukiristo.<verse eid="EPH 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11"/>Unum atsu abina kishoo ru nyaka unga aka abee na asɛng umɛn isha rimɔ̃ɔ̃ iwe abinga ru ubok iwɛrhɛmɛn nggu Ukiristo. <verse eid="EPH 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12"/>Unga akorha akɛrɛ ha ngge itsú umɛn, abika agbaashia ifosa ru Ukiristo, ama akpoi unga ru nggaa irhirhangnga. <verse eid="EPH 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13"/>Nu umbi ikɛi aka atomumbɔ umbi ru Ukiristo ivang umbi aka igũ urhɛm idzidzɛrhe, Isarhe Iyiki Ize iyi ififɔrhmbi. Ri ivangmbi aka awe ru imangmang, umbɔ aka atsuka umbi Ipfu Isarsatangge iyiriyɛ umbɔ aka abemuwe nu ngge iwe utsar ugɛ umbi awe abi Unum. <verse eid="EPH 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14"/>Ipfu Isarsatangge ha Unum aka adzaa umɛn ngge itsú umɛn ihwɛng ugɛ unga awuri idzaanga ukammɛn unga aka abemuwa umɛn. Umɛn iwuri ikpomɛn abin hã ri ivangyɛ Unum aka idzuma afɔna umɛn abirabɛ iki iwe abinga, ngge itsú umɛn ikpoi unga ru nggaa irhirhangnga.<verse eid="EPH 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Itar uwɛɛ nu ifɛn-Num</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15"/>Umum iki igũmum arherhe imangmangmbi ru Uteijee Uyesu nu ibibemambi ra abika adɔsa kishoo. <verse eid="EPH 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16"/>Nggee umum isi inekukũ ifɛn-Num ni itar uwɛɛ ru unga ri itsimbi. <verse eid="EPH 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17"/>Inu irhusa Unum uwu Uteijeemɛn Uyesu Ukiristo, Utɛ uwu ikpikpoi, ama adzaa umbi Ipfu itsoi na adɛyiwa itsinga ru umbi, ngge itsú umbi ama ahwɛng unga atai. <verse eid="EPH 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18"/>Umum ifɛn-Num ikɛi ugɛ unga ama ayanguwa amɛnmbi ngge itsú umbi ahwɛng ifosayɛ unga aka ayisa umbi awe. Ifosa hã iwe iyiyɛi nggaa idorhnga aka abemuwe abika adɔsa. <verse eid="EPH 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19"/>Umum ifɛn-Num ikɛi ĩgɛ nu umbi ahwɛng ijeenga iki inangge ubɛn ijee. Ijee ha iyika umɛn abi imangmang ru Ukiristo. Iyɛrɛ ana awe nggaa ijee ha <verse eid="EPH 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20"/>iyiriyɛ Unum aka akũ ri ivangyɛ unga aka asoyiwe Ukiristo ra akpe na atsu unga asei nu ubok ughanga ra afã. <verse eid="EPH 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21"/>Ukiristo agha iyɛrhe ananga ubɛn iyɛrhe, ubɛn ikpũ ípfu iyiki igha iyɛrhe nu iyiki iwe ru ijee akarhãrhã, ípfu itser-Num nu ípfu iyiki ibewe kishoo. Ugaunga unangkpɔ ubɛn ugau. Asi iwea ri ivang iyɛrɛ ukpekũ bɔr nu ivang iyiki ibiba ikɛi. <verse eid="EPH 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22"/>Unum aka atsukuka abina kishoo ra andaidaknga na atsũ unga awe itsia ru ubɛn ubin ri iyike abika adɔsa, <verse eid="EPH 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23"/>aka awe iyornga. Unga atsu atɔke umbɔ na atsu atɔke ubɛn abin ra ananga kishoo.<verse eid="EPH 1:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Isisok ra akpe nggu Ukiristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1"/>Umbi aka agaumbi nggu Unum ri itsi arhimmbi. <verse eid="EPH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2"/>Ri ivang hã umbi aka isaka idɔsa atsĩndĩ abi upfung ukpirɛ nu Undenggũ. Unga agha iyɛrhe ípfu iyiki ibewe nu icɛrɛ unga ani itɔ̃ itser ra abika akpɛ̃ idɔsu Unum. <verse eid="EPH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3"/>Umɛn kishoo igamɛn ibɛkmɛn ru nyaka umbɔ ri ivangyɛ umɛn idɔsi nggaa amɛn aki arhim ni ikorha abinkɛ ngge iki ibee ri ifɛrhkɔngge. Ru nyaka umbɔ kishoo ngge itsu Unum awe ra avɔm nggu umɛn. Amar umɛn ru nyaka ha. <verse eid="EPH 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4"/>Bɔr Unum abema umɛn akarhãrhã, nu atorhnga awe arhɛrhɛ. <verse eid="EPH 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5"/>Arhimmɛn atsu umɛn ikpe, bɔr Unum aka asoyiwa umɛn nggu Ukiristo umɛn iwe ru urhɛ. Awu imimuta itsu umɛn ikpo ififɔrh. <verse eid="EPH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6"/>Unum asoyiwa umɛn nggu Ukiristo Uyesu na atsu umɛn isei nggu unga ra afã ru ubok iwɛrhɛmɛn nggu unga. <verse eid="EPH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7"/>Unum akorha akɛrɛ ha ngge itsú unuma unga awuri idɛyiwanga ugɛ imimutanga inangngge abina kishoo. Unga adɛyiwa umɛn akɛrɛ ha ru ubok inna hã Ukiristo Uyesu aka akorhe. <verse eid="EPH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8"/>Awu ru ubok imimuta umbɔ aka afɔrh umbi, ru ubok imangmangmbi ru Ukiristo. Asi iwea ikikorhambi, awu izũwũ Unum. <verse eid="EPH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9"/>Asi iwea ru ubok itser iyiki ize, nggee unera asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ afĩrhũnga. <verse eid="EPH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10"/>Umɛn iwe abinkɛ Unum aka amuna. Unga agbisha umɛn ru ubok iwɛrhɛmɛn nggu Ukiristo Uyesu nu umɛn itɔ̃ itser iyiki ize, iyiriyɛ unga aka abee umɛn itɔ̃ isha rimɔ̃ɔ̃.<verse eid="EPH 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Unying ru Ukiristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11"/>Nggee, àka ayita ugɛ umbi asi iwembi abi Uyahuda ri imar. Abika ayisa atsimbɔ &lt;&lt;abi usorhe&gt;&gt; ayisa umbi &lt;&lt;abirabɛ aka ashimbɔ nu usorhe&gt;&gt;. Bɔr usorhe uwe ubinkpi anera aka akũ abok akorhe. <verse eid="EPH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12"/>Àka ayita ugɛ ri ivang hã umbi aka asi iwembi nggu Ukiristo, umbi asi iwembi aner Uisrairha, umbi awe abirabɛ aka asi íyɛimbɔ ubinkpi Unum aka abemuwe abi Uyahuda. Umbi ashimbi ri ifosa na ashimbi ru Unum ru upfung. <verse eid="EPH 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13"/>Ri ivang hã umbi adermbi ru Unum, bɔr icɛrɛ ru ubok iwɛrhɛmbi nggu Ukiristo Uyesu, umbɔ aka akũna umbi aba akhapa ru ubok adzirh Ukiristo.<verse eid="EPH 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14"/>Ukiristo nibikanga awe ididɔɔrmɛn. Unga atsu abi Uyahuda nu atsen abi Uyahuda awe unying na abupuwe ubandzin ukpuku ukpukpɛ̃ɛ̃ uku utsu igigau. <verse eid="EPH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15"/>Unga akorha akɛrɛ ri ikwɛɛte Íkpem ri ivangyɛ unga aka akpe. Unga akpenuwe ri ifɛna kishoo abinkɛ Íkpem iki igɔr igɛ awu ufang ngge ikorhe. Unga abee itsu abi Uyahuda nu atsen abi Uyahuda awu unying ru ubok iwɛrhɛmbɔ nggu unga, iyiriyɛ iki itsu ididɔɔr. <verse eid="EPH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16"/>Ru ukpui uku ufa ha, unga agbopa umbɔ ru Unum ru ubok akpenga ri igãrhãmau ucucii na afɛre ikpikpɛ̃ɛ̃mbɔ. <verse eid="EPH 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17"/>Unga aba adũwã Isarhe Iyiki Ize iyi ididɔɔr ru umbi aka awe ukuka ru Unum nu ididɔɔr ra abika akhapa ru unga. <verse eid="EPH 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18"/>Ru uboknga umɛn iki ikpo utsĩndĩ uwuku uzĩ ru Utɛ ri Ipfu-Num unying.<verse eid="EPH 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19"/>Umbi abirabɛ aka asi iwembi abi Unum na awe atsen, umbi asi iwembi rimi icɛrɛ, bɔr umbi awe abi ugau ra aner Unum aka awe abi iyanga. <verse eid="EPH 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20"/>Adzin iya ha nu atarh idzin abi itser Uyesu nu abika asɔm Arherhu-Num, nggu Ukiristo Uyesu nibikanga aka awe utarh ãgboki idzin. <verse eid="EPH 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21"/>Ru unga agbopi iya ha kishoo iwe unying na atsu ike iwe Iya-Num isarsatake ru Uteijee. <verse eid="EPH 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22"/>Ru unga, umbi aka awe atsen abi Uyahuda ikɛi umbɔ anu idzin umbi awe urhɔnga ri iya ra anangkɛ Ipfu-Num iki isei.<verse eid="EPH 2:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Uburhu nu atsen abi Uyahuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1"/>Akɛrɛ ha utsu umum, Uburhu, ifɛna-Num ru umbi. Umum iwe ru ugborzĩ ru ubok idzowe Isarhe Ukiristo Uyesu ru umbi atsen abi Uyahuda.<verse eid="EPH 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2"/>Idzidzɛrhe umbi aka agũmbi Unum aka acorhuwa umum na adzaa itser iyɛrɛ umum itɔ̃wã umbi. <verse eid="EPH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3"/>Ngge iwu iwiwɔk Unum unga aka adɛyiwa umum ri irhi, iyiriyɛ umum iki itarzhang itsɛng. <verse eid="EPH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4"/>Ivangyɛ umbi aka ivarhe itsɛng iyɛrɛ, mɔcɛ umbi awuri idɛ̃ɛ̃ ahwɛngmbi iwiwe uwu ihwihwɛngmum ri iwiwɔk Ukiristo. <verse eid="EPH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5"/>Iwiwɔk iyɛrɛ umbɔ asi itsu undankpu isha ahwɛngmbɔ. Icɛrɛ Unum aka atsu Ipfunga itsu ihwihwɛng izĩ ra asarkasar abi itser Uyesu nu abika asɔm Arherhu-Num. <verse eid="EPH 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6"/>Iwiwɔk ha iwu ugɛ ru ubok Isarhe Iyiki Ize atsen abi Uyahuda awe abi ukam nggu Uisrairha. Umbɔ awe iyora unying, na agasha urhɔnga ri ibibemuwe ru ubok imangmang ru Ukiristo Uyesu.<verse eid="EPH 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7"/>Umum iwe uner itser Isarhe Iyiki Ize iyɛrɛ ru ubok ijee Unum nu izũwũ umatanga aka adzaa umum. <verse eid="EPH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8"/>Umum ihwɛng, umum iwe uku ucia ru kishoo abika adɔsa, bɔr umata ukpirɛ unga aka adzaa umum, iyiriyɛ umum iki idzowe ra atsen abi Uyahuda, isarhe idorh iyi Ukiristo iki isi ímaangge, <verse eid="EPH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9"/>ni idɛyiwe ubɛn unera ukupɛ̃ɛ̃ iwiwɔk Unum, uwuku umuna abina kishoo aka awɔk isha rimɔ̃ɔ̃. <verse eid="EPH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10"/>Ubin Unum aka abee ikorhe, abee itsu ayɛrhe nu abi ijee aka awe ípfu ahwɛng nggaa itsoinga icɛrɛ. Unga abee akũ ikikɔng abika adɔsa akorha akɛrɛ ha. <verse eid="EPH 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11"/>Unga abee ikorha akɛrɛ ha na adɔrha amunu upfunga iyiriyɛ unga aka akorhe ru ubok Ukiristo Uyesu Uteijeemɛn. <verse eid="EPH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12"/>Ru unga nu ru ubok imangmangmɛn ru unga, umɛn idɛ̃ɛ̃ izĩ ru Unum nggu ififɔn nu ikeramɛn. <verse eid="EPH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13"/>Umum ishɔ̃rhã umbi ugɛ niba atsũwũkumbi amɛnmbi ri itsi ayetnummum ri itsimbi, ake awe ikpikpoimbi.<verse eid="EPH 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uburhu afɛne-Num ra abi Uafisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14"/>Ngge itsu umum itar arhu ru Utɛ. <verse eid="EPH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15"/>Ru unga abi iyanga kishoo ra afã nu abĩ aka akpo itsokmbɔ. <verse eid="EPH 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16"/>Umum ifɛn-Num ugɛ ru nggaa igɔngnga, unga ama atsuka umbi iker ru ubok Ipfunga ra amɛnmbi, <verse eid="EPH 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17"/>ngge itsú Ukiristo ama asei ra amɛnmbi ru ubok imangmang. Umum ifɛn-Num ugɛ umbi adɛ̃ɛ̃ aker ri ibibema, <verse eid="EPH 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18"/>na awe ru ijee nggu abika adɔsa kishoo. Umum ifɛn-Num ugɛ umbi awuri ihwɛngmbi itɛi nu ider nu igɔng nu ighor ibibemu Ukiristo iwu uguse, <verse eid="EPH 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19"/>na ahwɛng ibibemayɛ iki inangngge ihwihwɛng. Umum ifɛn-Num ikɛi ugɛ umbi ama adzuma atɔk nggu ikikorhe iyi Unum.<verse eid="EPH 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20"/>Unum adɛ̃ɛ̃ akorha abinkɛ aka anangke ubinkpi umɛn iki irhusa unga use abinkɛ umɛn iki ifɛrhkɔ unga adɛ̃ɛ̃ akorhunga, ru ubok ijeenga iki itɔ̃ itser ru umɛn. <verse eid="EPH 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21"/>Abika adɔsa nu Ukiristo Uyesu ama akowe unga ikpikpoi ru kishoo andanna ugbagbaa! Iwerimi.<verse eid="EPH 3:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Abika adɔsa agbopa ri iyor Ukiristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1"/>Nggee, umum Uburhu, iki iwe uner ugborzĩ ri idɔsu Uteijee, umum ishɔ̃rhã umbi asei nggu amɛnkɛ aka amɛ̃ɛ̃ uyisakpi umbɔ aka ayisa umbi awe aner Unum. <verse eid="EPH 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2"/>Àka awe undzumu abika arhɛrhitsi nu ididɔɔr, àka adɔng amɛnmbi, na abima nggu adɔka ri ibibema. <verse eid="EPH 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3"/>Àka atsu amɛnmbi ri igbopa atsimbi awu unying ri Ipfu-Num ru ubok ididɔɔr iki ibow umbi urhɔnga. <verse eid="EPH 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4"/>Umɛn kishoo iwe iyora unying nggu Ipfu-Num unying. Umbɔ ayisa umɛn ri ifosi unying. <verse eid="EPH 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5"/>Umɛn iwe ru Uteijee unying, imangmang unying nu ubɔtisima unying. <verse eid="EPH 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6"/>Umɛn kishoo iwe ru Unum nu Utɛ unying. Unga agha iyɛrhe ru umɛn kishoo, atɔ̃ itser ru ubokmɛn kishoo na asei ru umɛn kishoo.<verse eid="EPH 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7"/>Bɔr ubɛn unera ru umɛn umbɔ aka adzaambɔ umɛn imimuta ru utsĩndĩwi Ukiristo aka abee igasha ngge. <verse eid="EPH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8"/>Ngge itsu Arherhu-Num agɔr agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">&lt;&lt;Ivangyɛ unga aka azĩ ra afafã,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">unga akũ nggu abɔɔ unga aka adzui azĩa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">na adzowe ízũwã ra anernga.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 68:18">Amb 68.18</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="EPH 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9"/>Agben &lt;&lt;unga aka azĩ ra afafã&gt;&gt; awu use? Agbena awu ugɛ unga aka agbaashia acipuwanga ru upfung. <verse eid="EPH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10"/>Unga uwuku ucipuwa awu unga hã azĩ ra afafã aka anangke afafã kishoo, ngge itsú unga atɔke inanga kishoo nggu itsikamnga. <verse eid="EPH 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11"/>Nggee Ukiristo nibikanga asɛng abɔɔ awe abi itser Uyesu, abɔɔ awe abika asɔm Arherhu-Num, abɔɔ awe abika adzowe Isarhe Iyiki Ize, nu abɔɔ awe abika adarh abika adɔsa na awu abika amesuwe. <verse eid="EPH 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12"/>Unga akorha akɛrɛ ha ngge itsú unga agbisha abika adɔsa ru umbɔ atɔ̃ itser Unum, ngge itsú umbɔ adzin iyor Ukiristo. <verse eid="EPH 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13"/>Akɛrɛ ha awuri ikorhuke utsɛku umɛn kishoo iki igbopi iwe unying ri imangmangmɛn nu ihwɛng Ungwɛ̃ Unum nu iseng iba iwe undzumu aner ru nyaku Ukiristo ra abina kishoo.<verse eid="EPH 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14"/>Mɔcɛ umɛn isi íbvui iwemɛn awɛkaci. Abi atapa aka abee ikorhe iki ibewe asi írhɛmmbɔ umɛn. Imesi igbɛrangwĩmbɔ isi íyiingge umɛn izĩ ra asu ni izĩ ra andzing ru nyaku ukhukhɔɔ amɛ̃ ibvun amɛ̃ nu ugba iki iyii. <verse eid="EPH 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15"/>Bɔr ru ubok irherhi idzidzɛrhe ri ibibema, umɛn iwuri iseng ni iwe undzumunga ru nyaku Ukiristo aka awu itsia. <verse eid="EPH 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16"/>Umɛn iwu iyornga nu umɛn kishoo igbopa iwe urhɔnga ri icim. Iyor iyɛrɛ iseng ni idzin itsike ri ibibema, ru nyaku ubɛn ugau ukpɔɔ iki itɔ̃itserkpɔ.<verse eid="EPH 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Imesa iyi isisei abika adɔsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17"/>Nggee umum idɛyiwa umbi akɛrɛ ni igbiita atombi nggu ijee iyi Uteijee, ugɛ awu ufang umbi aneke ikorhe ru nyaka atsen abi Uyahuda iki ikorhe ri ifɛrhkɔ iyiki itãrhã. <verse eid="EPH 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18"/>Umbɔ awe ru uzĩ ri ihwihwɛngmbɔ na agau atsimbɔ ri ibibɛk iyi Unum ri itsi ida ihwihwɛngmbɔ iki idze ru iker itsimbɔ. <verse eid="EPH 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19"/>Ashimbɔ ra atsa, umbɔ adzowe atsimbɔ ri ikorhe abin iyormbɔ iki ibee ngge itsú umbɔ akorhe ubɛn ikpũ abin ishĩ na abee itoma akorhe.<verse eid="EPH 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20"/>Bɔr umbi asi imesumbi ru Ukiristo ru ikpũ atsĩndĩ hã. <verse eid="EPH 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21"/>Abinkɛ umbi aka agũ ri itsi Ukiristo nu abinkɛ umbɔ aka amesuwa umbi ru unga iwu idzidzɛrhe ha iki idzeku Uyesu. <verse eid="EPH 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22"/>Umbɔ aka amesuwambɔ umbi ugɛ umbi neke ikorhe ikpũ ibibɛkmbi iyiki igbe, iyiriyɛ iki iwe iyiki itãrhã ru ubok irhirhɛm iyi ikponi iyor. <verse eid="EPH 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23"/>Àka neke Ipfu-Num itsu umbi awe abika afa ri ifɛrhkɔ amɛnmbi, <verse eid="EPH 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24"/>na akorhe ru nyaku uner uku ufa, uwuruwi umbɔ aka amuna unga awe ru nyaku Unum ri irhirhika nu isisar iyi idzidzɛrhe.<verse eid="EPH 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25"/>Nggee ubɛn unera ru umbi awu ufang unga neke igbɛrangwĩ na arherhe idzidzɛrhe nggu udɔka, ubinkutsu umɛn kishoo iwu agau ri iyora unying. <verse eid="EPH 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26"/>Itsɛng Arherhu-Num igɔr igɛ, &lt;&lt;Ri igũ avɔm, umbi niba awembi abi arhim.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 4:4">Amb 4.4</ref></char>.</note> Niba aneke unum utsĩkpɔ nu umbi ana awe ra avɔm. <verse eid="EPH 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27"/>Niba adzowukumbi ugarh ru Undenggũ. <verse eid="EPH 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28"/>Unerwi aka awu uvɛu awu ufang unga neke ivɛu, bɔr atɔ̃ itser. Imɛ̃ngge unga akũ aboknga atɔ̃ itser iyiki iwe ru ugarh, ngge itsú unga ama akpo ubin unga aka idzowe izũwã ra abika abubee.<verse eid="EPH 4:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29"/>Niba neke irhɛm iyiki itãrhã idzekangge ra angwĩmbi, bɔr aka arherhi irhɛm iyiki ize iyiriyɛ iki iyike ri idzin adɔka ra abinkɛ umbɔ aka abee, ngge ima idzowe iker ra abirabɛ aka ikpeto. <verse eid="EPH 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30"/>Niba adakukumbi amɛn Ipfu Isarsatangge, iyiriyɛ Unum aka akũ atsuka utsar ru umbi, ngge idɛyiwe ugɛ ru unum uku utsu uvau unga awuri ifɔrh umbi. <verse eid="EPH 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31"/>Àka atare kishoo amɛn aka abewe, isa nu avɔm. Àka aneke ifuw nu irhena adɔka nu ubɛn ikpũ ikpikpɛ̃ɛ̃. <verse eid="EPH 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32"/>Àka awe ru inna na agũ atorh adɔka, àka atsũwe adɔka, ru nyaku Unum aka atsũwã umbi ru ubok Ukiristo.<verse eid="EPH 4:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1"/>Umbi awe awɛkaci Unum aka abema, nggee, àka awe abika amesa ru Unum, <verse eid="EPH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2"/>na asei isei iyi ibibema, ru nyaku Ukiristo aka abema umɛn na adzowe itsinga awe idɛm Unum ru umɛn isung nu idɛm ru Unum.<verse eid="EPH 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3"/>Bɔr ru umbi isi imɛ̃ngge umbɔ agũ arherhe uko irha nggu ubin use unerwi aka asi iwea utsɛ̃ngo use utsakngo, use ikorhu ubɛn abin atsa, use unyɛ̃ɛ̃, ubinkutsu akɛrɛ ha asi imɛ̃ke ra abika adɔsa. <verse eid="EPH 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4"/>Ikɛi isi imɛ̃ngge umbi arherha arherhi ishĩ, arherhe agugge use itsui agwerha aki ishĩ. Abin akɛrɛ ha isi imɛ̃ngge aner Unum akorhe, bɔr àka awe abika atang awɛɛ ru Unum. <verse eid="EPH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5"/>Umbi ahwɛngmbi akarhãrhã ugɛ uner uwuku urha nggu ubin use unerwi aka asi iwea utsɛ̃nga use utsaknga, uner uwuku ukorhu ubɛn abin atsa, use uner unyɛ̃ɛ̃ ashia ru ugau ru ukam Iyɛrhe Ukiristo nu iyi Unum. Uner unyɛ̃ɛ̃ awu uner uwuku udzowe igɔng ra abin upfung ugɛɛ ake awe Unum. <verse eid="EPH 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6"/>Niba aneke unera arhɛma umbi nggu irhɛm iyiki itãrhã, ubinkutsu ikpũ iyi ha itsu avɔm Unum iba ra abirabɛ aka akpɛ̃ɛ̃ idɔsa unga. <verse eid="EPH 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7"/>Nggee àka neke iwe nggu umbɔ ri ikorhe akɛrɛ ha.<verse eid="EPH 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8"/>Umbi awe ru uzĩ ri inggbaashia, bɔr icɛrɛ umbi awe ri irhirhang nggu Uteijee. Àka asei ru nyaka awɛ irhirhang, <verse eid="EPH 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9"/>ubinkutsu ikpũrhã irhirhang iwe ri iyiki ize, irhirhika, nu idzidzɛrhe. <verse eid="EPH 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10"/>Àka amesa ahwɛng ubin Uteijee aka abee. <verse eid="EPH 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11"/>Niba akorhumbi abin uzĩ aka asi íghwɛrke ikpũrhã, bɔr aka akũna ake adzeka ra awiya. <verse eid="EPH 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12"/>Awu ubin atsa umɛn irherha arherhe abinkɛ abika akpɛ̃ɛ̃ idɔsu Unum iki ikorhe ri iwɔk. <verse eid="EPH 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13"/>Bɔr ubɛn ubinkpi aka akũ adzeka ri irhirhang anera anyãmbɔ ngge, <verse eid="EPH 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14"/>ubinkutsu awu irhirhang itsu umbɔ anyã ubɛn abin. Ngge itsu itsɛng Arherhu-Num igɔr igɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">&lt;&lt;Uzir, ungo uner urhɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 5:14">uso ra akpe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">nu Ukiristo arhang ru ungo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EPH 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15"/>Àka akpɔm amɛnmbi ri ibibɛkmbi, niba awembi ru nyaka agugge bɔr àka awe ru isarasu. <verse eid="EPH 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16"/>Àka akorhe iyiki ize ubɛn ivang umbi aka idɛ̃ɛ̃ akorhe, ubinkutsu inuma ibewungge. <verse eid="EPH 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17"/>Nggee àka niba awembi agugge, bɔr àka ahwɛng ubin Uteijee aka abee umbi akorhe. <verse eid="EPH 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18"/>Niba afĩrhũmbi nggu adɛ, ake awuri itsu umbi atoma ra arhim. Nu ngge iki iwe rimi, àka awe nggu Ipfu-Num. <verse eid="EPH 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19"/>Àka arherha arherhe nggu adɔka ra ambom aki ubvur Unum nu ambom abika adɔsa aka amuna nu ambom Ipfu Isarsatangge aka atsu ru umbi. Àka atsũ ambom na abar abin ru Uteijee ra amɛnmbi. <verse eid="EPH 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20"/>Ubɛn ivang àka atar uwɛɛ ru Utɛ Unum ru ubɛn ubin, ri itsok Uteijeemɛn Uyesu Ukiristo.<verse eid="EPH 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Akatsɛrh nu akatsak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21"/>Àka adzowe atsimbi ra adɔka ri iwei Ukiristo.<verse eid="EPH 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22"/>Umbi akatsɛrh, àka adzowe atsimbi ra atsakmbi ru nyaka umbi iki ikorhuwe Uteijee. <verse eid="EPH 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23"/>Ubinkutsu ukutsa unga awu itsia ru utsɛ̃nga ru nyaka Ukiristo aka awu itsia ra abika adɔsa, abirabɛ aka awu iyornga nu unga awe uner uwuku ufɔrh umbɔ. <verse eid="EPH 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24"/>Ru nyaka abika adɔsa àka adzowe atsimbɔ ru Ukiristo, rimi hã akatsɛrh imɛ̃ngge umbɔ adzowe atsimbɔ ra atsakmbɔ ra abina kishoo.<verse eid="EPH 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25"/>Umbi akatsak, àka abema atsɛ̃mbi, ru nyaku Ukiristo àka abema abika adɔsa na adzowe urhɛnga ru umbɔ <verse eid="EPH 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26"/>ngge itsú umbɔ asar na atɛn ri isorh umbɔ nggu amɛ̃ ru ubok Arherhu-Num. <verse eid="EPH 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27"/>Unga akorhe akɛrɛ ngge itsú unga akũ abika adɔsa kishoo aba ri itsikamnga ru nyaku usarkasar utsɛrh uku ufa. Umbɔ awuri ishimbɔ na arhim use utau, bɔr awuri iwe asarkasar abika asheru uvau. <verse eid="EPH 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28"/>Rimi hã, akatsak àka abema atsɛ̃mbi ru nyaka ayormbi. Unerwi aka abemu utsɛ̃nga abemi itsinga. <verse eid="EPH 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29"/>Unera asi íkpɛ̃ɛ̃ iyornga, bɔr unga afuka na agbisha ingge, ru nyaku Ukiristo aki ikorhe ra abika adɔsa, <verse eid="EPH 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30"/>ubinkutsu umɛn iwu agau iyornga. <verse eid="EPH 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31"/>Itsɛng Arherhu-Num igɔr igɛ, &lt;&lt;Akɛrɛ ha atsu ukutsa awuri neke utɛnga nu uyanga na agbopa nggu utsɛ̃nga, umbɔ ikivarhambɔ awuri iwe iyora unying.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Ing 2.24</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="EPH 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32"/>Írhɛm iyɛrɛ ha aghong ihwihwɛng, bɔr umum inu irherhe ake ri itsi Ukiristo nu abika adɔsa. <verse eid="EPH 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33"/>Nggee ikɛi umum igɔr ĩgɛ ubɛn ukutsak awu ufang unga abemu utsɛ̃nga ru nyaka unga aka abemi itsinga, nu ukutsɛrh awu ufang unga adzowe imor ru utsaknga.<verse eid="EPH 5:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Awɛkaci nu atei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1"/>Umbi awɛkaci, irhikungge umbi adɔsa ateimbi, ubinkutsu umbi awe abi Uteijee. <verse eid="EPH 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2"/>Itsɛng Arherhu-Num igɔr igɛ, &lt;&lt;Udzowe imor utɛngo nu uyango.&gt;&gt; Ngge iwe ikpem iyi inggbaashia iki iwe nggu ibibemuwe iki igɔr igɛ, <verse eid="EPH 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3"/>&lt;&lt;Ukorhe rimi ngge ima itsu ungo useisei iyiki ize nu ungo uma ubɛk imɛka irhɛirhɛ ru upfung.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 5:16">Iva 5.16</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="EPH 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4"/>Umbi atei, àka neke isa nggu angwɛ̃mbi ubɛn ivang, bɔr àka adzowe umbɔ itsũwã na amesuwe umbɔ ri itsi Uteijee.<verse eid="EPH 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Agãrhã nu ateiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5"/>Umbi agãrhã, àka adɔsa ateiyambi abi upfung ru nyaka umbi aka adɔsu Ukiristo. Àka akorha ake nggu imor nu iwei ra amɛn unying. <verse eid="EPH 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6"/>Àka adɔsa umbɔ asi iwea ugɛ ri inyĩnyã ukpekũ na abee umbɔ akpoi umbi, bɔr ru nyaka agãrhũ Ukiristo, àka akorhe ubin Unum aka abee ra amɛnmbi. <verse eid="EPH 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7"/>Àka atɔ̃ itsermbi nggu anggɔm, ugɛ umbi ani itɔ̃we Uteijee na asi iwea ra anera. <verse eid="EPH 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8"/>Ubinkutsu umbi ahwɛngmbi agɛ Uteijee awuri idzowuka itosa ru ubɛn unera ru ubin uku uze unga aka akorhe, uko ugãrhã use uwuku ufɔn.<verse eid="EPH 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9"/>Umbi ateiya, àka akorhe rimi hã ra agãrhãmbi. Niba agɔrmbi agãrhãmbi agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo uba usi itɔ̃ itser iyɛrɛ, umum iwuri ikwɛr ungo.&gt;&gt; Ubinkutsu umbi ahwɛngmbi ugɛ uwu ha aka awe uteiyambɔ nu uwu umbi awu unying ra afã, na ashia ri itɛngasu.<verse eid="EPH 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abin iwa Unum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10"/>Ri imimasha, àka adɛ̃ɛ̃ aker ru Uteijee nu ru nggaa ijeenga. <verse eid="EPH 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11"/>Àka atsim undzumu abin iwa Unum, ngge itsú umbi adɛ̃ɛ̃ akpɛ̃ɛ̃ irhirhɛm Undenggũ. <verse eid="EPH 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12"/>Umɛn isi itangmɛn iwa nggu anera, bɔr iwu nggu ípfu iyiki ibewe iki iwe ru iyɛrhe nu iker nu ijee ru uzĩ ukpu upfung ukpirɛ nu ípfu iyiki ibewe iyiriyɛ iki ishingge ru upfung ukpirɛ. <verse eid="EPH 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13"/>Nggee àka atsim undzumu abin iwa Unum, ngge itsú ivangyɛ unum uku ubewe uku iba, umbi ama adɛ̃ɛ̃ atang iwa. Ivang umbi aka itang iwa amaa, umbi awuri idɛ̃ɛ̃ akermbi. <verse eid="EPH 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14"/>Àka adɛ̃ɛ̃ aker, nggu ikpɔm idzidzɛrhe iyiki ibow nu ufurhsĩmbi, nu irhirhika ngge iwe atorho azɔu aki ikɔkmbi, <verse eid="EPH 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15"/>àka atsu abadak, abadak ha awu ru nyaki ididɔɔr iki idzeki Isarhe Iyiki Ize na atsu umbi agbisha abina kishoo adzɛu itang iwa. <verse eid="EPH 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16"/>Utoma ra akɛrɛ ha, àka anyangu imangmang ngge iwe urhɛrɛ aki irhiwuwe urha agwee Undenggũ aka itang umbi <verse eid="EPH 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17"/>Àka atsim ifur azɔu iyi ififɔrh, na anyangu ikon ikider iyi Ipfu-Num, ike iwu Arherhu-Num. <verse eid="EPH 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18"/>Na afɛn-Num ubɛn ivang na aneke Ipfu-Num idarh umbi ru ubɛn ikpũ ifɛn-Nummbi nu ifɛn. Àka atsu asumbi na abima ri ifɛn-Nummbi ra abika adɔsa kishoo.<verse eid="EPH 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19"/>Ikɛi àka afɛna-Num ru umum, àka afɛn Unum unga ama adzaa umum irhɛmyɛ umum iki ikũ idɛyiwe anera abinkɛ umbɔ aka awɔk ri Isarhe Iyiki Ize nggu ikeramɛn. <verse eid="EPH 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20"/>Umum iwe ru ugborzĩ icɛrɛ ri idzowe Isarhe Iyiki Ize ha. Àka ifɛn-Num ru umum ima idzowe ngge ugɛɛ Unum aka abee nggu isheri iwei. <figure style="fig" alt="Our armor/weapons is like that of a soldier" file="gt00122.tif" size="col" loc="6.20" copy="Gordon Thompson" ref="6.11-17">Abin iwamɛn awe ru nyaka aki uner iwa</figure><verse eid="EPH 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Imimasha ighwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21"/>Utikiku awu ungwɛ̃mɛn umɛn iki ibema nu uner itser idzidzɛrhe ru Uteijee. Unga awuri idɛyiwanga umbi ubɛn ubin, ngge itsú umbi ikɛi ama ahwɛng iwiwe umum nu ubinkpi umum iki ikorhe. <verse eid="EPH 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22"/>Umum idene unga aba ru umbi ra abin akɛrɛ, ugɛ umbi ama ahwɛng iwiwe umɛn, nu unga ama afituwa umbi.<verse eid="EPH 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23"/>Unum Utɛ nu Uteijee Uyesu Ukiristo ama adzaa umbi ididɔɔr, umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn. Umbɔ ama atsu umbi atoma ri ibema adɔka nu iwe ru imangmang ru Ukiristo. <verse eid="EPH 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24"/>Imimuta iwe nggu kishoo abika abemu Uteijeemɛn Uyesu Ukiristo nggu ibibemayɛ iki isi íkpengge.<verse eid="EPH 6:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6"/>
</usx>
